WEBVTT

00:00:23.740 --> 00:00:28.860
I'm going to be late! Late!
 Why was my alarm clock off?!

00:00:29.420 --> 00:00:31.870
I have no time for breakfast!

00:00:40.890 --> 00:00:44.760
Oh no--- Oh no!

00:02:23.260 --> 00:02:26.170
High School Lullaby

00:02:26.970 --> 00:02:30.120
What is this?! 
 I've grown!

00:02:30.120 --> 00:02:35.730
Is this what growing up is like?!
 It can't be!

00:02:41.090 --> 00:02:43.160
Kaya-san!

00:02:44.460 --> 00:02:45.820
Kaya-san!

00:02:50.710 --> 00:02:53.870
- Went to work at seven?! 
- I'm home.

00:02:54.620 --> 00:02:57.530
<i>Oh no! Kyo-nei is home!</i>

00:02:57.640 --> 00:03:02.570
<i>I don't want to explain myself! 
 I have to get out of here!</i>

00:03:03.810 --> 00:03:07.080
Oh man, the early morning shoot is rough.

00:03:08.500 --> 00:03:10.310
I'm going, bye!

00:03:12.230 --> 00:03:13.520
See ya!

00:03:15.640 --> 00:03:21.460
Wow, she looks sexy all of a sudden. 
 The summer definitely changes girls.

00:03:23.160 --> 00:03:28.270
<i>I have to talk to Kaya-san about this. 
 I can't let anyone else know!</i>

00:03:28.660 --> 00:03:30.160
<i>Especially...</i>

00:03:32.110 --> 00:03:36.230
<i>...Yasaka! He'll make fun of me for sure!</i>

00:03:40.020 --> 00:03:43.750
No! No! No! 
 This isn't my body!

00:03:53.660 --> 00:03:58.130
- What is it?! 
- Is there something wrong with you, Kanako?!

00:03:58.130 --> 00:04:03.490
- What?
- The planets in the solar system are aligned drastically today!

00:04:03.810 --> 00:04:10.450
- It's worse than that one day. 
- That one day? - Have you forgotten about this?

00:04:10.840 --> 00:04:15.600
"To protect the peace of Yachio!" 
 "I will punish those who get in my way!"

00:04:15.770 --> 00:04:18.750
"Maid warrior Yamasaki Kanako..."

00:04:19.680 --> 00:04:22.020
"Is here!"

00:04:26.350 --> 00:04:32.320
Today, when the sun passes Leo in the Zodiac...

00:04:32.530 --> 00:04:37.640
...Capricorn the opposite sign gets clouded with the shade of the moon.

00:04:37.780 --> 00:04:40.130
Sounds like a mysterious day!

00:04:40.200 --> 00:04:44.170
I'm sure that some miracle is going to happen to Kanako today!

00:04:44.630 --> 00:04:49.500
- Here transform! - I won't! 
- It's going to be extraordinary!

00:04:49.920 --> 00:04:52.760
I'm going through something extraordinary.

00:04:58.300 --> 00:05:00.540
- Jun-kun?!
- Yes!

00:05:00.930 --> 00:05:05.470
- What are you doing here?! 
- Um...

00:05:09.060 --> 00:05:14.100
- Jun-kun what happened to you?! 
- Um, this is...

00:05:15.060 --> 00:05:20.240
Hey, Arashi what are you rambling about?! 
 Get out of the way.

00:05:21.660 --> 00:05:24.640
- Who? 
- Who is it?!

00:05:25.530 --> 00:05:31.530
- Um she is...
- I'm Jun's sister, Ryoko! Thanks for taking care of my little brother!

00:05:31.640 --> 00:05:36.930
- I'm the eldest daughter of the Kamigamo family. Kamigamo Ryoko! 
- Oh, OK.

00:05:37.320 --> 00:05:41.260
Arashi-san don't say anything! Please be quiet.

00:05:43.640 --> 00:05:49.630
- Oh, Jun's sister, huh?
- Um, yea. Yes.

00:05:50.130 --> 00:05:54.320
I don't live with Jun but...

00:05:54.530 --> 00:05:57.130
You have a smile of an angel!

00:05:57.440 --> 00:06:02.520
- What?! 
- I'm serious! You're beautiful Ryoko-san!

00:06:02.660 --> 00:06:06.460
- Smile a little bit for me.
- Don't tease me!

00:06:07.280 --> 00:06:09.300
Oh, I get it.

00:06:09.980 --> 00:06:14.170
<i>Oh, no! Arashi-san thinks this is funny!</i>

00:06:14.480 --> 00:06:19.630
- I want to tell them! 
- Does something hurt, Arashi-san?!

00:06:19.670 --> 00:06:23.570
No, Hajime-chan. I'm not hurting but I want to say...

00:06:26.910 --> 00:06:28.510
- ...Oh, it's nothing.
- What?

00:06:30.320 --> 00:06:34.260
<i>No, they're going to find out.
 Where's Kaya-san?</i>

00:06:34.440 --> 00:06:39.550
-<i> I want to tell Kaya-san and get help from her!</i> 
- What's all the fuss about?

00:06:42.810 --> 00:06:46.470
- Kaya-san!
- Um, who are you?

00:06:47.070 --> 00:06:52.610
- That's Jun's older sister! - Arashi-san! 
- Right? Kamigamo Ryoko-san!

00:06:54.390 --> 00:07:00.210
<i>- No, I want to tell Kaya-san the truth!</i>
- Jun's...

00:07:00.530 --> 00:07:03.830
...Oh! You must be the oldest sister!

00:07:04.610 --> 00:07:08.230
Sorry for the late introduction.

00:07:08.590 --> 00:07:13.900
My name is Kaya and I'm staying at the Kamigamo household.

00:07:14.020 --> 00:07:18.600
Oh.
 I'm sorry for my late introduction.

00:07:18.740 --> 00:07:21.260
My name is Kamigamo Ryoko.

00:07:22.790 --> 00:07:26.160
Ryoko-san, what you're wearing is...

00:07:28.110 --> 00:07:33.120
I was just jogging. 
I sweat more than I thought so...

00:07:33.290 --> 00:07:36.740
...may I borrow a change of clothes?

00:07:39.190 --> 00:07:43.130
<i>- I have to do something about this!</i>
- Ryoko-san. - Yes?

00:07:43.310 --> 00:07:48.560
I have your change of clothes here. 
 We only had staff uniforms.

00:07:48.840 --> 00:07:54.240
- Oh, thank you.
- I will see you later. - Hey! Wait a minute!

00:07:55.160 --> 00:08:00.270
- Kaya-san. 
- Huh? - I want you to keep this a secret.

00:08:00.770 --> 00:08:04.610
Secret? Oh is that right?!

00:08:05.710 --> 00:08:10.140
I didn't know you were in on Jun's surprise birthday party!

00:08:11.280 --> 00:08:14.470
Today is Jun's birthday!

00:08:15.610 --> 00:08:21.180
I know! We've planned this without Jun knowing!

00:08:21.290 --> 00:08:27.150
That's why I had Jun come in the evening and I had the early morning shift.

00:08:27.150 --> 00:08:30.950
I turned off Jun's alarm and sneaked out.

00:08:32.440 --> 00:08:36.520
Jun didn't know anything and she was quietly asleep.

00:08:36.590 --> 00:08:40.640
I didn't know that you were planning the same thing.

00:08:41.030 --> 00:08:46.460
- Is that why you came to Hako-bune?
- Yea. You're right.

00:08:46.710 --> 00:08:49.190
Jun's so fortunate.

00:08:49.340 --> 00:08:53.280
Ryoko, let's make sure it's a surprise for Jun!

00:08:54.800 --> 00:08:59.200
<i>You're already revealing it to me, Kaya-san!</i>

00:09:05.950 --> 00:09:09.930
- It looks great, Ryoko-san!
- Really?

00:09:10.000 --> 00:09:12.910
- Yea, it's wonderful. 
- The Kamigamo family members...

00:09:12.910 --> 00:09:17.560
...have such a noble aura.

00:09:18.590 --> 00:09:25.470
Ryoko-san is going to help us with Jun's surprise birthday party.

00:09:25.620 --> 00:09:30.340
Oh that's great! 
 We were getting ready for the surprise but...

00:09:30.520 --> 00:09:35.770
- ...we didn't know what Jun liked.
- Now we can ask you, Ryoko-san.

00:09:36.020 --> 00:09:40.630
- You know Jun like you know yourself! 
- Well, yea.

00:09:40.700 --> 00:09:46.920
Oh, that's great. I wanted to ask you. 
 What does Jun dislike?

00:09:47.200 --> 00:09:53.090
- Something he dislikes?- Master said the important part in a surprise is the mountains and the valleys.

00:09:53.090 --> 00:09:55.860
- Mountains and valleys?
- Yes! Mountains and valleys.

00:09:55.860 --> 00:09:59.450
Low and high points. Cranes and turtles. Bring them down and pick them back up!

00:09:59.630 --> 00:10:04.450
It's in the foundation of surprises. To scare them and then make them really happy!

00:10:05.090 --> 00:10:10.990
- Is that how it is?
- So, what is Jun afraid of?

00:10:11.310 --> 00:10:15.030
We only know that he doesn't like roaches and rats.

00:10:17.270 --> 00:10:22.170
How about, when he comes into the store we shower him with toy roaches?

00:10:22.270 --> 00:10:27.100
- No, No, no! That's too much! 
- Yea, it's a café here.

00:10:27.100 --> 00:10:32.360
Well --- well--- he doesn't like manjus!

00:10:32.520 --> 00:10:36.660
- He said he was afraid of manjus! 
- What? - Really?!

00:10:36.790 --> 00:10:40.080
I gave her a manju as a snack before.

00:10:40.310 --> 00:10:45.730
- Oh, I did something bad.
- Some things you don't know until you ask.

00:10:45.830 --> 00:10:51.350
- Is there something else?
- That Jun-kun doesn't like? - I want to know what he likes too.

00:10:51.350 --> 00:10:55.680
Oh, and also, let us know what Jun wants.

00:10:56.390 --> 00:11:00.910
- Um, I can't answer all at once.
- You don't have to ask, Hajime-chan?

00:11:01.040 --> 00:11:05.360
- About Jun-kun.
- What? Me? - It's a good chance!

00:11:06.460 --> 00:11:08.720
I don't have anything in particular.

00:11:09.270 --> 00:11:13.240
Um, if he's afraid of majus...

00:11:13.410 --> 00:11:18.350
...does Jun-kun not like sweets in general?

00:11:18.770 --> 00:11:21.410
He's a boy. That might be the case.

00:11:21.640 --> 00:11:26.650
- So, does that mean we have to plan our main surprise again?! 
- For real!

00:11:26.810 --> 00:11:29.650
Um, what's the main surprise?

00:11:29.710 --> 00:11:33.680
The main surprise of today's birthday party is, pie tossing!

00:11:33.880 --> 00:11:37.170
- Pie tossing?! We're going to be tossing pies?!
- Yes.

00:11:37.620 --> 00:11:41.500
Jun rambled about how he wanted to toss pies, when he was sleeping.

00:11:41.630 --> 00:11:45.920
When I heard that, I thought he really wanted to do it.

00:11:46.600 --> 00:11:51.800
- Was he really saying that in his sleep? 
- We took turns since this morning...

00:11:51.930 --> 00:11:56.260
- ...to bake the pies. 
- Look! Over there!

00:11:56.480 --> 00:12:00.230
- Wow.
- Kaya was really against it at first.

00:12:00.360 --> 00:12:06.010
Of course. Why would we toss something so delicious?! It's disrespectful to the pie!

00:12:06.200 --> 00:12:10.760
But, we decided to do it to see Jun-kun smile.

00:12:10.760 --> 00:12:16.210
We have plastic covers on the floor so we can eat all the pies after we're done tossing them.

00:12:16.470 --> 00:12:20.020
We found the perfect consistency for the whipped cream too.

00:12:20.350 --> 00:12:25.580
Further, we made a pie crust that would withstand the shock of the impact.

00:12:25.870 --> 00:12:32.360
-It was such a long and harsh road. 
- She gained 3kg from tasting it. - 2.7kg!

00:12:32.710 --> 00:12:38.620
- You guys put that much thought into it, huh? 
- It only comes around once a year.

00:12:38.720 --> 00:12:45.020
- And it's the summer time. We're grateful that we can celebrate together! - Arashi-san.

00:12:49.120 --> 00:12:52.830
It'll be alright. Jun--- he...

00:12:53.150 --> 00:12:57.030
- ...loves pies! 
- Really?! - That's great!

00:12:57.030 --> 00:13:01.030
Alright! Our surprise won't go wrong!

00:13:01.310 --> 00:13:05.870
Alright, everyone! Let's surprise Kamigamo with everything we got!

00:13:07.490 --> 00:13:10.330
<i>I'm already surprised enough.</i>

00:13:13.550 --> 00:13:15.790
Natsu No Arashi!

00:13:16.190 --> 00:13:18.580
Can I get some salt?

00:13:25.300 --> 00:13:29.700
- You didn't tell Kaya?
- I can't in this situation.

00:13:31.450 --> 00:13:35.530
You seem to be having fun, Arashi-san. 
 Is it because I'm anxious?!

00:13:35.650 --> 00:13:40.940
No, it's not. I'm having fun because we're all together!

00:13:41.230 --> 00:13:45.910
- It's no different from an ordinary day. 
- That's why it's great.

00:13:46.960 --> 00:13:49.190
- Is that how it goes? 
- Yea.

00:13:50.310 --> 00:13:54.770
- I brought it.
- Thanks - Manjus and...

00:13:56.450 --> 00:13:59.130
...I just put the tarp across the floor?

00:14:00.050 --> 00:14:03.460
- Who is that? 
- It's Ryoko-san. Isn't she beautiful?!

00:14:03.720 --> 00:14:05.500
Hey, Yasaka---kun.

00:14:05.560 --> 00:14:10.980
- Surprisingly, she's the older sister of that weakling, Kamigamo. 
- Weakling...

00:14:11.200 --> 00:14:13.850
Oh, she's quite the Japanese beauty.

00:14:13.940 --> 00:14:18.940
Don't you think so? Ryoko-san has strength hidden in her beauty!

00:14:18.940 --> 00:14:22.670
Oh, wow. It's surprising that Hajime-chan praises someone that much.

00:14:23.430 --> 00:14:27.580
I wish that Kamigamo would have some of the essence she has.

00:14:27.830 --> 00:14:30.700
He's such a sissy city boy.

00:14:31.620 --> 00:14:35.860
Kyoko-san is similar.
 All the women from the Kamigamo family are...

00:14:36.140 --> 00:14:39.270
...elegant and wonderful.

00:14:39.390 --> 00:14:43.470
- Oh, stop it.
- We don't come across much of them nowadays but...

00:14:43.600 --> 00:14:46.720
...she's like an old fashioned, well mannered lady.

00:14:47.040 --> 00:14:50.610
Well, Hakobune has a variety of them.

00:14:55.640 --> 00:15:00.190
- No, I'm not. 
- There's no need to deny it, Ryoko-san.

00:15:00.290 --> 00:15:03.000
Ryoko-san, you're such an attractive lady!

00:15:03.790 --> 00:15:07.070
Wow, Hajime-chan, is that a profession of your love?!

00:15:07.070 --> 00:15:10.710
No. I'm all for you, Arashi-san!

00:15:10.770 --> 00:15:15.450
No way, you haven't stopped talking about her.

00:15:15.640 --> 00:15:17.080
He's all talk.

00:15:18.730 --> 00:15:21.440
- Yayoi-san?!
- I'm sorry.

00:15:21.630 --> 00:15:25.330
You said the same thing as Jun-kun, so...

00:15:25.740 --> 00:15:30.010
- Really?!
- I heard siblings are alike.

00:15:31.000 --> 00:15:33.100
She's nothing like him!

00:15:33.830 --> 00:15:37.240
Right. Jun is a little rough around the edges.

00:15:37.460 --> 00:15:42.910
Sometimes he's irresponsible. 
 I had to do the dishes over because of him.

00:15:43.320 --> 00:15:47.310
Wow, it must have been quite a thing for Master to wash it again.

00:15:47.530 --> 00:15:49.090
Don't tell this to anyone, but...

00:15:49.280 --> 00:15:53.580
...Jun is stingy on the syrup that he uses for his iced coffee.

00:15:53.650 --> 00:15:56.510
That's personal preference.

00:15:57.280 --> 00:16:01.700
- I can't believe they're all talking about me like that. 
- They really look at you closely Jun-kun.

00:16:09.570 --> 00:16:14.130
Thank you Ryoko-san. You gave good insight about Kamigamo to everyone.

00:16:14.510 --> 00:16:17.380
Now our surprise birthday party is perfect!

00:16:18.520 --> 00:16:23.910
- Um. 
- Yes? - You didn't ask anything about Jun did you, Yasaka-kun.

00:16:25.120 --> 00:16:29.770
It's not because I want you to ask about him but, I just want to know.

00:16:30.180 --> 00:16:33.270
If there's something I want to know about him I'll ask him personally.

00:16:33.430 --> 00:16:38.460
But, he doesn't answer with a straight answer does he? 
 He's kind of cynical.

00:16:39.550 --> 00:16:42.100
There's no one more honest than he is.

00:16:42.100 --> 00:16:45.730
Gets frustrated when he gets mad. 
 Smiles when it's fun.

00:16:45.890 --> 00:16:50.000
I guess you call that simple minded and not honest?

00:16:50.440 --> 00:16:53.370
Well, I like that about him.

00:16:56.020 --> 00:16:58.280
- Like?!
- Something wrong?

00:16:59.770 --> 00:17:00.830
Oh, it's nothing.

00:17:03.470 --> 00:17:06.270
- Hajime-chan! 
- What's wrong, Arashi-san?

00:17:06.590 --> 00:17:10.160
All the fruits that we bought for the birthday cake has gone bad!

00:17:10.890 --> 00:17:14.270
- Why?
- We had it in the refrigerator in the morning but...

00:17:14.490 --> 00:17:19.110
...someone left it out when they were cooling the pies.

00:17:19.210 --> 00:17:21.440
Oh, no! That'll do it.

00:17:21.440 --> 00:17:24.680
What should we do?! 
 We don't have time to go and buy new ones!

00:17:25.580 --> 00:17:27.260
Leave it up to me!

00:17:31.060 --> 00:17:34.690
-Hajime-chan?! 
- Hey!

00:17:40.610 --> 00:17:42.810
Here you go!
Wild strawberries!

00:17:43.380 --> 00:17:45.770
- It's beautiful. 
- Wow, amazing!

00:17:47.300 --> 00:17:49.880
I didn't know they grew here!

00:17:49.880 --> 00:17:52.840
It's my secret snack stash!

00:17:54.240 --> 00:17:56.950
- Is this edible?
- Of course!

00:18:01.990 --> 00:18:07.340
- It's delicious! 
- I'm going to take this to Kaya-san!

00:18:15.430 --> 00:18:20.430
Jun-kun! 
 Your body is going back to normal!

00:18:24.670 --> 00:18:25.840
Hurry! Go!

00:18:42.700 --> 00:18:45.500
How weird. All I did was eat one.

00:18:45.690 --> 00:18:49.070
The bitter sweet taste is still in my mouth.

00:18:57.670 --> 00:18:59.550
I'm going to be surprised.
 I'm going to be surprised.

00:19:08.470 --> 00:19:10.690
Oh no! I'm surprised.

00:19:12.260 --> 00:19:13.980
I'm scared of manjus.

00:19:15.920 --> 00:19:17.230
What?!

00:19:19.900 --> 00:19:21.430
Here I go, Jun!

00:19:45.070 --> 00:19:47.930
Happy birthday!

00:19:51.050 --> 00:19:53.570
Surprise is successful.

00:19:55.230 --> 00:19:57.420
Jun, happy birthday.

00:20:00.390 --> 00:20:01.370
Thank you.

00:20:05.770 --> 00:20:10.450
- I heard it was your dream to have a pie toss.
- You're right.

00:20:10.840 --> 00:20:14.500
We secretly made these pies since this morning.

00:20:14.910 --> 00:20:17.140
Really? I didn't know.

00:20:17.270 --> 00:20:19.820
- Hurry and eat one!
- Yes.

00:20:19.980 --> 00:20:23.670
Hajime-chan picked those wild strawberries.

00:20:24.630 --> 00:20:28.420
Eat it and be surprised!
 That's the taste of wild strawberries!

00:20:32.080 --> 00:20:37.020
A city boy like you never ate wild strawberries before.

00:20:39.150 --> 00:20:41.890
- I've had some before.
- For real?

00:20:43.010 --> 00:20:46.030
What?! Where did you eat it?!

00:20:47.690 --> 00:20:50.050
Why do I have to tell you?

00:20:54.060 --> 00:20:54.790
It's so good!

00:22:26.340 --> 00:22:28.380
How are you Yayoi?

00:22:28.540 --> 00:22:30.610
I'm doing well Kanako.

00:22:30.710 --> 00:22:32.940
That's good to hear.

00:22:33.190 --> 00:22:36.310
I saw another great moving picture.

00:22:36.310 --> 00:22:39.310
What was this moving picture called?

00:22:39.440 --> 00:22:42.780
It was, I forget the title.

00:22:43.100 --> 00:22:45.360
Can you tell me what the story was about?

00:22:45.550 --> 00:22:47.370
Sure thing!

00:22:48.960 --> 00:22:52.240
It was about a young boy growing up.

00:22:52.560 --> 00:22:57.590
He was taken away by a mysterious being and taken to the land of the gods.

00:22:57.910 --> 00:23:01.510
He grows up as their bonds become stronger.

00:23:01.920 --> 00:23:03.330
And together...

00:23:03.490 --> 00:23:08.490
... to obtain the gleam that they once had, they head for the top of the mountain.

00:23:08.610 --> 00:23:11.640
They go through an epic battle against a great enemy.

00:23:11.890 --> 00:23:15.590
Wow, what a great, wonderful, cool, and funny story!

00:23:15.840 --> 00:23:21.670
There was a phrase that this young boy said when he called his friend.

00:23:22.090 --> 00:23:23.840
What is it? Can you tell me?

00:23:27.660 --> 00:23:29.220
Ryujin Ma...

00:23:31.130 --> 00:23:34.380
- Speaking of pie tossing? 
- I don't like tossing food.

00:23:34.570 --> 00:23:37.790
When I see the whip cream go all over on TV...

00:23:38.720 --> 00:23:40.850
They use shaving cream on TV!

00:23:41.330 --> 00:23:43.110
Wake up early tomorrow morning!
